{"path":"header/ctgmath","title":"Standard library header <ctgmath> (C++11)(until C++20), <tgmath.h> (C++11)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">Standard library header</span> &lt;ctgmath&gt;&nbsp;<span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx20\">(until C++20)</span>, &lt;tgmath.h&gt;&nbsp;<span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/header/ctgmath","section":"header","kind":"page","summary":"This header was originally in the C standard library as <tgmath.h>.","html":"<p>This header was originally in the C standard library as <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/tgmath\"><code>&lt;tgmath.h&gt;</code></a>.\n</p><p>This header is part of the <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric\">numeric</a> library.\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h3 id=\"Includes\">Includes</h3>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/ccomplex\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>&lt;ccomplex&gt;</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-deprecated-cxx17\">(deprecated in C++17)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx20\">(removed in C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> Simply includes the header <a href=\"/w/cpp/header/complex\"><code>&lt;complex&gt;</code></a></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cmath\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>&lt;cmath&gt;</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math\">Common mathematics functions</a></td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p><code>&lt;ctgmath&gt;</code> is deprecated in C++17 and removed in C++20. Corresponding <code>&lt;tgmath.h&gt;</code> is still available in C++20.\n</p>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"header","title":"C++ Standard Library headers"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"Standard library header <ctgmath> (C++11)(until C++20), <tgmath.h> (C++11)","children":[{"label":"Includes","children":[{"label":"<ccomplex>","note":"Simply includes the header <complex>"},{"label":"<cmath>","note":"Common mathematics functions"}]},{"label":"Notes","note":"<ctgmath> is deprecated in C++17 and removed in C++20. Corresponding <tgmath.h> is still available in C++20."}]},"standards":["C++11","C++17","C++20"],"wordCount":51,"codeBlockCount":0}
